# Laboratory Maniac replaces only its controller's draws: "If you would draw a card". Bot1's Ancestral Recall makes Bot2, whose
# library holds one card, draw three: the first is drawn, the other two are draws from an empty library that nothing replaces, and
# Bot2 loses the game to the state-based action for them (CR 121.4, 704.5b) - not to a win of Bot1's (CR 104.2b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Laboratory Maniac
Ancestral Recall
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Laboratory Maniac.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Result = Bot1 won
Bot2.LostTo = EmptyLibrary
Bot2.Hand.Count = 8
